// Content-Addressed Build Cache, 4-Tier Fingerprint Hierarchy, Interface Early Cutoff,
// Poisoning/Corruption Defense, Atomic Staging & Reproducible Packaging
// (`compiler/build/cache/mod.ax`, T852 / E20.1).
//
// Implements SPEC-110 §4 (`AXS-BLD-030`..`AXS-BLD-034`, `INV-BLD-001`..`INV-BLD-003`).

